todo.md
docs/planning/
docs/operating-rules.md
docs/data-retention.md
docs/adfu-offizier-einsatzablauf.md
docs/einsatzrapport-workflow.md
docs/testing/rapport-drill.md
PROVIDER_NEUTRAL_MIGRATION_PLAN.md

# Per-station reference geodata is station data (restricted utility cadastre, etc.) — it
# lives in a private data repo and is loaded via `admin_geodata`, never bundled here.
public/leitungskataster/
tools/symbols-new.json
# Generated by tools/gen_symbols.py, same as symbols-new.json above — committing one
# generated output while ignoring its sibling was just an oversight.
tools/symbols-review.html

# Die Ein-Datei-Variante der Landingpage wird gebaut, nicht eingecheckt.
site/dist/

# Local compose customisations (build-from-source, host-specific ports). The .example is
# tracked and copied by `scripts/setup.sh --build`; the copy is yours and never ours.
docker-compose.override.yml
